# Every hostname this project is allowed to contact, one per line.
# Enforced by .github/workflows/network-surface.yml on every push and PR:
# a hostname in tabroom_bridge.py or plugin.js that is not listed here fails
# the build. Adding one requires an explicit, reviewable commit to this file.
#
# This backs the "these are the only network connections" claim in the README
# and SECURITY.md, so that claim cannot quietly stop being true.

# openCaselist — sign in, and fetch your own rounds. The only host that
# receives credentials.
api.opencaselist.com

# GitHub — check for a newer helper version and download it if accepted.
# api.github.com serves the release metadata; the release assets themselves
# are served from these hosts.
api.github.com
github.com
objects.githubusercontent.com
